    "description": "Title:\nHemingray 56 Glass Insulator Whitall Tatum Electrical Utility Clear Amber Brown Lot\nOptional Title:\nLot of 3 Vintage Glass & Porcelain Electrical Insulators\nBrand:\nHemingray, Whitall Tatum, Unknown\nCategory:\nHard Goods\nType:\nElectrical insulator\nCountry Of Origin:\nUnited States\nMaterial:\nGlass, porcelain\nModel:\nHemingray-56, Whitall Tatum 511, Unknown\nMpn:\n56, 511, Unknown\nUnit Quantity:\n3\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nEnhance your vintage collection or utility display with this unique lot of 3 antique electrical insulators. This set includes a clear Hemingray-56 glass insulator, an amber Whitall Tatum No. 511 glass insulator (both marked Made in U.S.A.), and a brown porcelain insulator of unknown make. Each piece showcases classic industrial designwith embossed brand marks on the glass models and a time-worn patina on the porcelain. Durable and historically significant, these insulators served as essentials in early telegraph and power lines. Perfect for repurposing, educational displays, or collectors, these authentic pieces come from trusted American manufacturers and offer both nostalgia and craftsmanship. Their robust construction ensures longevity for decorative or practical reuse. All pieces are original, showing minor wear consistent with age, adding to their authenticity.",
