    "description": "Condition:\nThis product is untested and functionality is not verified. This vintage smoking pipe features a classic bent calabash design with a rich wood grain finish on the shank and bowl. The mouthpiece is a curved black stem that fits comfortably. The rim of the bowl has a light-colored, possibly meerschaum-style inlay, giving it a distinctive aesthetic. This piece is ideal for collectors of tobacco memorabilia or those who appreciate vintage craftsmanship. It serves as a great display piece or a candidate for restoration. The wood shows a lovely natural patina that has developed over time, adding character to the piece.\nStyle: Bent Calabash\nMaterial: Wood, Synthetic\nColor: Brown, Black, Cream\nType: Smoking Pipe\nDesign: Deep curved shank\nFeatures: Large bowl opening\nThe item shows signs of previous use including charring inside the bowl and light surface wear consistent with age. Please review all photos for a detailed look at the condition and specific cosmetic details.",
